{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1444","id":4009057234,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87u9VvS","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1444","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1444.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1444.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1444","number":1444,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(method-map): add post-attempt MS rights/display gate (#1432)","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nAdds the post-attempt Mark Scheme **rights/display gate** for #1432 — a narrow sibling of the #1429 `PostAttemptReviewPayload` schema and the #1431 all-3530 read model. It defines, enforces and reports the granular Mark Scheme display gates as a pure, deterministic resolver plus a validator and readback.\n\n- `resolveRightsDisplayGate()` computes five **independent** student-display gates — `payload_student_display_allowed`, `structured_feedback_student_display_allowed`, `official_ms_text_student_display_allowed`, `official_ms_image_student_display_allowed`, `evidence_drawer_student_display_allowed` — and the source-asset split `review_status` / `rights_status` / `quality_status` / `student_display_allowed` / `debug_display_allowed`.\n- Answer-fact, source display, structured display, scoring-claim, debug/review display and student display gates are preserved as separate postures.\n\n## Hard rules enforced (validator, 8 cases)\n\nCases: rights-approved source, rights-review-required, rights-blocked, internal-only, candidate screenshot hidden, quality-blocked hidden, structured native without source image, structured derived feedback allowed while official image/text stay blocked.\n\n- Candidate screenshots are **never** student-facing.\n- Rights-unconfirmed / rights-blocked / internal-only source images are hidden from students (debug/review display retained).\n- Quality-blocked source images are hidden from students.\n- Structured **derived** display never implies official MS image/text approval.\n- Official source display approval never implies answer facts or scoring authority.\n- No `source_image_only` primary learner display.\n\n## Boundary\n\nUpstream schema/read-model are anchored from **checked-in artifacts only**. No production Supabase mutation, RAG reindex, vector-store mutation, external model/VLM call, or frontend UI integration.\n\n## Verification\n\n- New suite: `scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-rights-display-gate.test.js` — 10/10 pass.\n- Sibling post-attempt suites (schema #1429, boundary, adapter, read-model #1431) — 44/44 pass total.\n- ESLint (flat config): 0 errors on the new script + test.\n- Report/artifact registration guard: `pass`, 0 violations.\n- Builder runs deterministically and emits `validator_status: pass` (11/11 checks).\n\n## Artifacts\n\n- `scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-rights-display-gate.mjs`\n- `scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-rights-display-gate.test.js`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-rights-display-gate.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-rights-display-gate.validator-result.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-rights-display-gate.readback.md`\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","created_at":"2026-07-07T18:30:18Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T18:42:18Z","closed_at":"2026-07-07T18:42:18Z","merged_at":"2026-07-07T18:42:18Z","merge_commit_sha":"20c6a2f51032b59d0595412fef54a430143b8a60","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1444/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1444/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1444/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/0a8f83e2dfa8fe9c89042bf31b24a3efcb7b0146","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1432","ref":"feat/issue-1432","sha":"0a8f83e2dfa8fe9c89042bf31b24a3efcb7b0146","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api